%U A399728 2395525853733220192841813082,39796984076285166312905371532491,1314756406924535700696877908644132153
%N A399728 Number of labeled point-determining (mating) graphs on n vertices with no vertices of degree 1.
%C A399728 A graph is point-determining if distinct vertices have distinct open neighborhoods. Thus a(n) counts labeled graphs on n vertices such that N(u) != N(v) for u != v and no vertex has degree 1.
%H A399728 I. M. Gessel and J. Li, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/0705.0042">Enumeration of Point-Determining Graphs</a>, arXiv:0705.0042 [math.CO].
%H A399728 G. Kilibarda, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s00373-007-0692-5">Enumeration of Unlabelled Mating Graphs</a>, Graphs and Combinatorics 23 (2007), 183-199.
%F A399728 a(n) = n! * Sum_{lambda partition of n} (-1)^(n-l(lambda)) * B(l(lambda),m_1(lambda)) / z_lambda, where l(lambda) is the number of parts of lambda, m_i(lambda) is the multiplicity of i in lambda, and z_lambda = Product_{i>=1} i^m_i(lambda) * m_i(lambda)!.
%F A399728 B(k,r) = Sum_{s=0..k} (-1)^s * 2^binomial(k-s,2) * Sum_{t=max(0,s-k+r)..min(s,r)} binomial(r,t) * binomial(k-r,s-t) * C(s,t,r), where C(s,t,r) = Sum_{q=0..floor(t/2)} t! * (r-t)^(s-2*q) / ((t-2*q)! * 2^q * q!).
%e A399728 a(4) = 5: among the 64 labeled graphs on 4 vertices, exactly 5 are point-determining and have no vertex of degree 1.
%Y A399728 Cf. A101390 (unlabeled case), A006024 (labeled point-determining graphs), A059167 (labeled graphs with no vertices of degree 1).
%K A399728 nonn,new
